ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi097: GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET containing EDGE_LOOP with one EDGE_CURVE; host curve is CIRCLE 'long_way_around' (radius 1, XY plane, centre origin); arc traversal from t=5.5 to t=1.0 going the long way around past 2π; naive range-normalisation wraps to [1.0,5.5] reversing arc direction; start-vertex at t=5.5: (cos(5.5),sin(5.5),0) = (0.7081,-0.7061,0.0); end-vertex at t=1.0: (cos(1),sin(1),0); GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty; EDGE_CURVE IS wired into EDGE_LOOP; never orphaned */
